@Nomina_back_end_HostAddress = http://localhost:5288

### Verificar conexión a Mongo
GET {{Nomina_back_end_HostAddress}}/api/health/mongodb

### Crear usuario RR.HH.
POST {{Nomina_back_end_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificacion": "1-1111-1111",
  "nombre": "Admin RRHH",
  "correo": "rrhh@techsolutions.com",
  "rol": "RRHH",
  "departamentoId": "665f1c2a9b1e8a3d4c5e6f70",
  "puesto": "Encargado de Nómina",
  "jefaturaDirectaId": null,
  "fechaIngreso": "2024-01-15",
  "salarioBase": 850000,
  "tipoJornada": "Diurna",
  "horario": {
    "horaEntrada": "08:00",
    "horaSalida": "17:00",
    "diasLaborales": [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
  },
  "fotoUrl": null,
  "password": "Admin12345"
}

### Listar usuarios
GET {{Nomina_back_end_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios
Accept: application/json














### Login
# @name login
POST {{Nomina_back_end_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "rrhh@techsolutions.com",
  "password": "Admin12345"
}

### Listar usuarios (con token)
GET {{Nomina_back_end_HostAddress}}/api/usuarios
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}


